    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe5\ud83d\udfe5\ud83d\udfe5\ud83d\udfe7\ud83d\udfe7\ud83d\udfe7\ud83d\udfe8\ud83d\udfe8\ud83d\udfe8\ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe6\ud83d\udfe6\ud83d\udfe6\ud83d\udfea\ud83d\udfea\ud83d\udfea</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578290/extras/dd8b6aec72ce41069658fa7ca48bd784.poster.avif?t=1747311960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578290/extras/dd8b6aec72ce41069658fa7ca48bd784.webm?t=1747311960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578290/extras/dd8b6aec72ce41069658fa7ca48bd784.mp4?t=1747311960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay a while and relax! Pixel Fixel promises to provide as much relaxing color-matching gameplay as you desire! There are no in-app purchases, advertisements, or any other gimmicks! Totally free, and totally rewarding! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player is tasked with restoring a mixed-color gradient to its former glory! This helps train the player's eyes to color and provides a soothing and fulfilling feeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy hundreds of levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play against your friends in online 1v1 matches. Fastest to solve the puzzle, wins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself to complete the daily puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover secret codes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578290/extras/bb3d1608a357d5efc3f303a8c82a08d5.poster.avif?t=1747311960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578290/extras/bb3d1608a357d5efc3f303a8c82a08d5.webm?t=1747311960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578290/extras/bb3d1608a357d5efc3f303a8c82a08d5.mp4?t=1747311960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe5\ud83d\udfe5\ud83d\udfe5\ud83d\udfe7\ud83d\udfe7\ud83d\udfe7\ud83d\udfe8\ud83d\udfe8\ud83d\udfe8\ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe6\ud83d\udfe6\ud83d\udfe6\ud83d\udfea\ud83d\udfea\ud83d\udfea</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe5\ud83d\udfe5\ud83d\udfe5\ud83d\udfe7\ud83d\udfe7\ud83d\udfe7\ud83d\udfe8\ud83d\udfe8\ud83d\udfe8\ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe6\ud83d\udfe6\ud83d\udfe6\ud83d\udfea\ud83d\udfea\ud83d\udfea</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578290/extras/dd8b6aec72ce41069658fa7ca48bd784.poster.avif?t=1747311960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578290/extras/dd8b6aec72ce41069658fa7ca48bd784.webm?t=1747311960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578290/extras/dd8b6aec72ce41069658fa7ca48bd784.mp4?t=1747311960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay a while and relax! Pixel Fixel promises to provide as much relaxing color-matching gameplay as you desire! There are no in-app purchases, advertisements, or any other gimmicks! Totally free, and totally rewarding! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player is tasked with restoring a mixed-color gradient to its former glory! This helps train the player's eyes to color and provides a soothing and fulfilling feeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy hundreds of levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play against your friends in online 1v1 matches. Fastest to solve the puzzle, wins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself to complete the daily puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover secret codes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578290/extras/bb3d1608a357d5efc3f303a8c82a08d5.poster.avif?t=1747311960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578290/extras/bb3d1608a357d5efc3f303a8c82a08d5.webm?t=1747311960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578290/extras/bb3d1608a357d5efc3f303a8c82a08d5.mp4?t=1747311960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe5\ud83d\udfe5\ud83d\udfe5\ud83d\udfe7\ud83d\udfe7\ud83d\udfe7\ud83d\udfe8\ud83d\udfe8\ud83d\udfe8\ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe6\ud83d\udfe6\ud83d\udfe6\ud83d\udfea\ud83d\udfea\ud83d\udfea</p>",
    "short_description": "Pixel Fixel is a soothing game where players match tiles of various colors to form satisfying gradients. Arrange chaos into beautiful mosaics of colors! Complete levels on your own, triumph over daily puzzles or invite a friend to a friendly competition...",
